ll},{"name":"Whislash","rarity":5,"isFuture":null},{"name":"Whisperain","rarity":5,"isFuture":null},{"name":"Wild Mane","rarity":5,"isFuture":null},{"name":"Wind Chimes","rarity":5,"isFuture":null},{"name":"Windflit","rarity":5,"isFuture":null},{"name":"Windscoot","rarity":4,"isFuture":null},{"name":"Wiš'adel","rarity":6,"isFuture":null},{"name":"Wulfenite","rarity":5,"isFuture":null},{"name":"Xingzhu","rarity":5,"isFuture":null},{"name":"Yahata Umiri","rarity":5,"isFuture":null},{"name":"Yato","rarity":2,"isFuture":null},{"name":"Yu","rarity":6,"isFuture":null},{"name":"Yūtenji Nyamu","rarity":5,"isFuture":null},{"name":"Zima","rarity":5,"isFuture":null},{"name":"Zima the Raging Tide","rarity":6,"isFuture":null},{"name":"Zinogre S Catapult","rarity":5,"isFuture":null},{"name":"Zuo Le","rarity":6,"isFuture":null}],"techniqueUnitIcons":{},"techniqueBranchOperators":{},"techniqueGroupOperators":{},"techniqueRelatedOperators":{"Self-Sustain":{"entries":[{"name":"Blemishine","rarity":6,"isFuture":null},{"name":"Entelechia","rarity":6,"isFuture":null},{"name":"Executor the Ex Foedere","rarity":6,"isFuture":null},{"name":"Hoshiguma the Breacher","rarity":6,"isFuture":null}],"totalCount":96}},"forms":null,"skillRanges":null,"overviewRanges":[{"elite":0,"talent":null,"range":{"cols":2,"rows":1,"opCell":[1,1],"rangeCells":[[1,2]]}}],"voiceData":{"textLocale":"en","lines":[{"id":"CN_001","title":"Appointed as Assistant","text":"Doctor, you gotta be hungry! Try some of my onigiri. They're great!","category":"profile","status":"current","unlock":null,"order":1},{"id":"CN_002","title":"Talk 1","text":"I've got a lotta hobbies: martial art sparring, soccer… Oh! And Ikebana! Some took me as a warrior with more brawn than brains, and I'd say they're the ones who's got a fat head!","category":"profile","status":"current","unlock":null,"order":2},{"id":"CN_003","title":"Talk 2","text":"My race eats other races? That's some old crap! Who told you that? Tch, those cowards, cooking up this nonsense behind my back. When I find'em, I'll give'em a lesson they'll never forget!","category":"profile","status":"current","unlock":null,"order":3},{"id":"CN_004","title":"Talk 3","text":"I'm born with this self-healing body. Even if I take a few cuts in the fight, the wounds will close back up in no time.","category":"profile","status":"current","unlock":null,"order":4},{"id":"CN_005","title":"Talk after Promotion 1","text":"Hey, Doctor, Rhodes Island's got a soccer tournament! C'mon, let's sign up together! No need to think twice! Just put me in your team, and it's in the bag. You'd better work your brain elsewhere, like a cool victory pose!","category":"profile","status":"current","unlock":null,"order":5},{"id":"CN_006","title":"Talk after Promotion 2","text":"You don't even recognize me on the battlefield? I just start cutting through enemies with a face as cold as my blade? Wow! Sounds hella badass! Wish I could watch myself out there.","category":"profile","status":"current","unlock":null,"order":6},{"id":"CN_007","title":"Talk after Trust Increase 1","text":"I got this problem where I kinda end up breaking stuff, so I'm working with my Ikebana teacher to control my strength. Besides, getting surrounded by all those pretty flowers makes me real happy!","category":"profile","status":"current","unlock":null,"order":7},{"id":"CN_008","title":"Talk after Trust Increase 2","text":"Strategy? Ehh, not really my forte. That's why I keep hopping right into the enemy's plans. But you, Doctor, you always stop me right before I lose my mind. Real nice to have you by my side.","category":"profile","status":"current","unlock":null,"order":8},{"id":"CN_009","title":"Talk after Trust Increase 3","text":"Actually, I've always been a gullible dummy. Got duped so bad in the past that I almost got myself killed a few times. But now I, Matoimaru, swear loyalty to you, Doctor! Because I know you'll never betray me.","category":"profile","status":"current","unlock":null,"order":9},{"id":"CN_010","title":"Idle","text":"Grr... Hey, no falling asleep, Doctor! I need a listener or I'm gonna die of boredom!","category":"profile","status":"current","unlock":null,"order":10},{"id":"CN_011","title":"Onboard","text":"Matoimaru, here to join Rhodes Island! My blade is at your command, Doctor!","category":"profile","status":"current","unlock":null,"order":11},{"id":"CN_012","title":"Watching Battle Record","text":"More fancy skills to beat those bad guys with!","category":"profile","status":"current","unlock":null,"order":12},{"id":"CN_013","title":"Promotion 1","text":"Doctor, put my strength to good work. That'll be the respect I deserve.","category":"profile","status":"current","unlock":null,"order":13},{"id":"CN_014","title":"Promotion 2","text":"Doctor, please stand back a bit. I don't want to hurt you when swinging my naginata. But I, Matoimaru, will bring us every victory in your name.","category":"profile","status":"current","unlock":null,"order":14},{"id":"CN_017","title":"Added to Squad","text":"Hah hah! You all look pretty tough. How about a warm-up with me?","category":"combat","status":"current","unlock":null,"order":17},{"id":"CN_018","title":"Appointed as Squad Leader","text":"Ugh, you want me to play captain? Then how am I suppose to throw myself into the battle!?","category":"combat","status":"current","unlock":null,"order":18},{"id":"CN_019","title":"Depart","text":"You guys ready to rumble? Then what are we waiting for!?","category":"combat","status":"current","unlock":null,"order":19},{"id":"CN_020","title":"Begin Operation","text":"Sorry to keep you waiting, bad guys!","category":"combat","status":"current","unlock":null,"order":20},{"id":"CN_021","title":"Selecting Operator 1","text":"I'm over here.","category":"combat","status":"current","unlock":null,"order":21},{"id":"CN_022","title":"Selecting Operator 2","text":"Just how long until it's my turn?","category":"combat","status":"current","unlock":null,"order":22},{"id":"CN_023","title":"Deployment 1","text":"Love that battlefield smell.","category":"combat","status":"current","unlock":null,"order":23},{"id":"CN_024","title":"Deployment 2","text":"Make 'em shake in their boots!","category":"combat","status":"current","unlock":null,"order":24},{"id":"CN_025","title":"In Battle 1","text":"Standing up to me? Haha, Ballsy!","category":"combat","status":"current","unlock":null,"order":25},{"id":"CN_026","title":"In Battle 2","text":"Ready to meet your demise?","category":"combat","status":"current","unlock":null,"order":26},{"id":"CN_027","title":"In Battle 3","text":"My blade shall rip you and your toy to ribbons!","category":"combat","status":"current","unlock":null,"order":27},{"id":"CN_028","title":"In Battle 4","text":"You end here!","category":"combat","status":"current","unlock":null,"order":28},{"id":"CN_029","title":"4-star Result","text":"A sea of fire and a mountain of blades... Now that's what I call a fight. This is the battlefield I've always dreamed of.","category":"combat","status":"current","unlock":null,"order":29},{"id":"CN_030","title":"3-star Result","text":"Doctor, I got 'em all! Huh? what happened here? Everything's busted… Um, wait a second, did I do it...?","category":"combat","status":"current","unlock":null,"order":30},{"id":"CN_031","title":"Sub 3-star Result","text":"I'll get 'em before they escape! Can't call the battle over unless we got every last of 'em!","category":"combat","status":"current","unlock":null,"order":31},{"id":"CN_032","title":"Operation Failure","text":"Retreat! I'll cover your escape. Make sure you don't get hit!","category":"combat","status":"current","unlock":null,"order":32},{"id":"CN_033","title":"Assigned to Facility","text":"Agh! Ow! My horn...!","category":"profile","status":"current","unlock":null,"order":33},{"id":"CN_034","title":"Tap","text":"Huh?","category":"profile","status":"current","unlock":null,"order":34},{"id":"CN_036","title":"Trust Tap","text":"What's with that smile on your face? Anything to share with me?","category":"profile","status":"current","unlock":null,"order":36},{"id":"CN_037","title":"Title","text":"Arknights.","category":"profile","status":"current","unlock":null,"order":37},{"id":"CN_038","title":"New Year's blessing","text":"Hey, Doctor, how does Rhodes Island celebrate the New Year? Oh, anything is welcome? Haha, alright then, I'll put together a soccer match with Matterhorn and the others! Make sure you come to watch!","category":"special","status":"current","unlock":null,"order":38},{"id":"CN_042","title":"Greeting","text":"Uh huh, I'm listening.","category":"special","status":"current","unlock":null,"order":42},{"id":"CN_043","title":"Birthday","text":"Happy birthday, Doctor! I wanted to fill your office with flowers, but my teacher said restraint is the first rule of Ikebana. So I made you this! And it should fit just fine on your desk!","category":"special","status":"current","unlock":null,"order":43},{"id":"CN_044","title":"Anniversary Celebration","text":"This blade brings nothing but trouble when I'm holding it. Good thing I can trust you to tell me where to swing it. That way, nothing can go wrong!","category":"special","status":"current","unlock":null,"order":44}],"packs":[{"id":"en","label":"English","actors":["Maddie Matsumoto"],"status":"current","audioTemplate":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/arkpedia/arkpedia-voice-english/58e999c42e9fb00832d571ab35a1666000557088/current/char_289_gyuki/{voiceIdLower}.mp3"},{"id":"jp","label":"Japanese","actors":["Airi Ohtsu"],"status":"current","audioTemplate":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/arkpedia/arkpedia-voice-japanese/15ab8a81f1fc3b7e9b5486cf00c5afdc4b948649/current/char_289_gyuki/{voiceIdLower}.mp3"},{"id":"cn","label":"Mandarin","actors":["Ellen Wang"],"status":"current","audioTemplate":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/arkpedia/arkpedia-voice-mandarin/88535cc2a7c43056f2c370850184545b8c478a43/current/char_289_gyuki/{voiceIdLower}.mp3"},{"id":"kr","label":"Korean","actors":["Chae Min-ji"],"status":"current","audioTemplate":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/arkpedia/arkpedia-voice-korean/38e75788058bbbbc5b17330a1591245fbb08f822/current/char_289_gyuki/{voiceIdLower}.mp3"}]}}}